ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models
Project Testing
1. Testing Overview
Testing is an important phase of ComicCraft to ensure that the application generates relevant comic stories, maintains character and scene consistency, handles user input correctly, and provides a reliable editing and export experience.
The testing process covers:
•	User interface
•	Backend APIs
•	Database
•	Gemini AI integration
•	Comic generation
•	Image/visual generation
•	Authentication
•	Error handling
•	Performance
•	Security
•	End-to-end workflow
________________________________________
2. Testing Objectives
The main objectives are:
1.	Verify that all functional requirements work correctly.
2.	Ensure Gemini generates relevant and structured comic content.
3.	Verify that characters remain consistent across scenes.
4.	Ensure users can edit generated comics.
5.	Verify that projects are correctly saved and retrieved.
6.	Ensure invalid inputs are handled safely.
7.	Test API and database reliability.
8.	Verify comic preview and export functionality.
9.	Identify and fix bugs before deployment.
10.	Ensure a smooth user experience.
________________________________________
