•	Visual description
•	Characters
•	Action
•	Dialogue
•	Narration
•	Optional sound effect
Example test
Panel Number: 1
Scene: Laboratory
Characters: Arun
Action: Examining robot
Dialogue: "What is this?"
Narration: "Deep beneath the city..."
