18. Performance Testing
Performance testing checks how quickly and reliably ComicCraft responds.
Areas to measure
•	Page loading time
•	API response time
•	Gemini generation time
•	Database query time
•	Image loading time
•	Export time
•	Concurrent users
Example
Test the system with:
1 user
10 users
50 users
100 users
and observe response times and failures.
AI generation latency should be measured separately from ordinary application/API latency because model calls can vary significantly.
