19. Security Testing
Security testing should verify:
•	Authentication.
•	Authorization.
•	Password protection.
•	API-key protection.
•	Project access control.
•	Input validation.
•	Secure API communication.
•	Protection against common web vulnerabilities.
Important test
User A should not be able to access or modify User B's comic project by changing a project ID in a request.
________________________________________
20. Usability Testing
A small group of users can be asked to create a comic without detailed instructions.
Observe:
•	Can users understand the interface?
•	Can they create a project easily?
•	Are AI controls understandable?
•	Can they edit panels?
•	Can they find the save/export options?
•	Are error messages clear?
User feedback can then be used to improve the interface.
