22. Error Handling Testing
Test common failure situations:
Scenario	Expected Behavior
Empty prompt	Show validation message
Invalid login	Show authentication error
Gemini unavailable	Show retry option
Network failure	Preserve existing work
Image generation failure	Allow retry/skip
Database failure	Show appropriate error
Invalid AI response	Reject/regenerate response
Session expired	Request authentication again
