24. Bug Tracking
During testing, bugs can be recorded using:
Bug ID	Description	Severity	Status
BUG-001	Dialogue not saved	Medium	Fixed
BUG-002	Panel image not loading	High	In Progress
BUG-003	Invalid prompt accepted	Low	Fixed
Severity levels
•	Critical – Application cannot function.
•	High – Major feature is unusable.
•	Medium – Feature works incorrectly in some situations.
•	Low – Minor UI or usability issue.
