Conclusion
The testing phase ensures that ComicCraft is not only capable of generating comics through Gemini but is also reliable, secure, editable, and user-friendly. Particular attention should be given to AI response validation, character consistency, API failures, data persistence, and end-to-end comic generation, since these are the most important parts of the application's workflow.

